   "text": "AI COMPANIES HIRING EARLY-CAREER TALENT (HIRING LIST)\n\nHere are 30 AI companies hiring junior talent right now, ranked by the number of early-career hires they've made recently. This is Week 192 of On My Radar, my weekly list of the companies I can't stop watching:\n\nUnifyApps - enterprise AI platform (New York)\nAttentive.ai - AI takeoff and estimating for construction (Wilmington)\nHarness - AI software delivery platform (San Francisco)\nEmergent - AI coding agents that build apps (Bangalore)\nAfterQuery - expert reasoning data for AI training (San Francisco)\no9 Solutions, Inc. - AI planning platform for supply chains (Dallas)\nSnorkel AI - expert data for AI development (San Francisco)\nCohere -",
