   "text": "These 7 companies back global talent and now they're hiring for jobs that pay up to $600K.\n\nBetween them, they have 500+ open roles. At Extraordinary.com, we've supported every one of these teams on immigration.\n\n1. Etched builds AI inference chips. 100+ roles, $100K-$400K. Head of Talent: Corey Richard\n\n2. Lovable lets anyone build apps by describing them. ~80 roles, $117K-$390K. Head of Talent: Charles Guillemet\n\n3. Ramp builds finance software. ~170 roles, $100K-$330K. Senior Director, People & Talent: Jen Zitterman\n\n4. Listen Labs builds an AI interviewer for customer research. ~20 roles, $85K-$360K.\n\n5. Aaru builds AI that simulates human behavior. 32 roles, and engineering pays $200K-$",
